  "editorial_notes": [
    "The publisher states 154 artists. The detailed contents listing runs from page 8 to page 314 in two-page increments, yielding 154 alphabet entries.",
    "Names are transcribed as printed in the detailed contents listing; variants and spelling differences in other catalogues are not silently reconciled.",
    "The two consecutive Does entries (pages 84 and 86) are retained separately because the contents listing gives two entries with the same name; identity must be checked in the book.",
    "A page entry is not automatically a hand-drawn graffiti specimen. Record medium, technique, context and visual inspection status after direct inspection.",
    "Do not create accepted glyph observations from this index or catalogue descriptions."
  ],
